WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.717 --> 00:00:04.741
BUT THE PEOPLE WILL BE HAPPY.

00:00:04.742 --> 00:00:07.323
THE PEOPLE OF THE WORLD WILL BE

00:00:07.324 --> 00:00:07.528
HAPPY.

00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:08.513
NEXT WE WILL TURN TO

00:00:08.514 --> 00:00:10.245
UNPRECEDENTED PROSPERITY THROUGH

00:00:10.246 --> 00:00:12.074
