00:00:12.109 --> 00:00:14.634
WE’LL PASS NEW TAX CUTS TO BOOST

00:00:14.635 --> 00:00:17.647
TAKE-HOME PAY PERIOD WILL BE

00:00:17.648 --> 00:00:19.104
CUTTING TAXES VERY SUBSTANTIALLY

00:00:19.138 --> 00:00:19.498
SUBSTANTIALLY.

00:00:19.499 --> 00:00:21.698
WE’VE HAD TREMENDOUS GROWTH

00:00:21.699 --> 00:00:23.775
UNTIL HE GOT HIT WITH THE CHINA

00:00:23.776 --> 00:00:24.418
VIRUS.

00:00:24.419 --> 00:00:26.203
WE WILL CONTINUE OUR HISTORIC

00:00:26.204 --> 00:00:26.978
REGULATORY CAMPAIGN.

00:00:26.979 --> 00:00:28.863
AS YOU KNOW, IN THREE AND A HALF

00:00:28.898 --> 00:00:30.864
YEARS WE HAVE CUT MORE

00:00:30.865 --> 00:00:31.887
REGULATIONS THAN ANY OTHER

00:00:31.922 --> 00:00:33.475
ADMINISTRATION, NO MATTER HOW

00:00:33.476 --> 00:00:35.034
