00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.503
ARE TALKING ABOUT.

00:00:36.504 --> 00:00:38.416
WE WILL ENACT FAIR TRADE DEALS

00:00:38.417 --> 00:00:41.046
AND WE ARE WORKING ON SEVEN

00:00:41.047 --> 00:00:42.952
MAJOR FAIR TRADE DEALS RIGHT

00:00:42.953 --> 00:00:43.529
NOW.

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.722
WHEN I SAY "FAIR," FOR HER OUR

00:00:45.724 --> 00:00:46.387
COUNTRY.

00:00:46.388 --> 00:00:49.641
OUR COUNTRY IS RIPPED OFF BY

00:00:49.642 --> 00:00:50.663
EVERY NATION.

00:00:50.664 --> 00:00:52.148
FRIEND, FOE, DIDN’T MATTER.

00:00:52.182 --> 00:00:54.575
EVERY NATION WAS RIPPING US OFF

00:00:54.577 --> 00:00:57.713
AT A LEVEL THAT IS JUST

00:00:57.747 --> 00:00:59.926
UNBELIEVABLE, TO BE HONEST.

00:00:59.928 --> 00:01:03.497
WE ARE GOING TO BE EXPANDING

00:01:03.531 --> 00:01:06.372
OPPORTUNITY ZONES, AND WE WILL

00:01:06.406 --> 00:01:08.240
KEEP THAT GOING.

00:01:08.242 --> 00:01:10.969
IT’S BEEN A TREMENDOUS PROGRAM.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.619
I WANT TO THANK SENATOR SCOTT,

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:14.731
SOUTH CAROLINA, FOR COMING UP

00:01:14.732 --> 00:01:16.729
WITH THAT WHOLE CONCEPT.

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:18.818
I LIKED IT RIGHT AWAY.

00:01:18.819 --> 00:01:21.538
THIS HAS TURNED OUT TO BE A

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:22.774
TREMENDOUS THING, ESPECIALLY FOR

00:01:22.776 --> 00:01:23.449
AFRICAN-AMERICANS AND

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:23.744
HISPANIC-AMERICANS.

00:01:23.746 --> 00:01:24.884
WE WILL CONTINUE TO UNLEASH

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:25.807
AMERICAN ENERGY.

00:01:25.808 --> 00:01:27.463
WE ARE NUMBER ONE OF THE WORLD,

00:01:27.498 --> 00:01:28.656
AND WE ARE TOTALLY ENERGY

